ighbourhoods about 500 metres square.  The two he has already are a suburba=
n subdivision of single-family homes and a group of four large shabonos whi=
ch may be replaced by smaller shabonos.  The different designs can be arran=
ged haphazardly in the residential areas.

Pierre is maintaining a written description and table layout of the space s=
tation as well as a DXF file of the actual design.  He can guide you on how=
 to submit your masterpiece for inclusion.

